<title>ITALY: TABLE-Italy April industrial orders up yr-yr.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Italy April industrial orders up yr-yr.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian industrial orders rose 14.5 percent year-on-year in April while turnover rose 9.1 percent, national statistics institute Istat said.</p>
</text>
